OL,3,ANigella Lawson is 'icing on the cake',
OL,4,ATV critics say as she enters Bake Off
OL,5,Atent
OL,6,
OL,7,FTV critics have described Nigella
OL,8,FLawson as the "icing on the cake" of
OL,9,FThe Great British Bake Off, after the
OL,10,Fshow returned for a new series on
OL,11,FTuesday.
OL,13,FLawson has replaced Dame Prue Leith,
OL,14,Fwho announced she was leaving earlier
OL,15,Fthis year after nearly a decade in the
OL,16,Fprogramme's famous tent.
OL,18,FThe Telegraph said Lawson gives the
OL,19,FChannel 4 series a "new lease of life",
OL,20,Fwhile Digital Spy agreed she was a
OL,21,F"brilliant addition" to the line-up.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
